pinyon-shift-fh1-render-test-v1
# Physics behaviour harness (#1071): the #1019 acceleration check. Free roam
# from the seed with the car to test selected: wake the car, then full
# throttle from frame 1100 for 12 s at a fixed 60 Hz clock. Run with
# --game-argument=--pinyon_shift_physics_trace=6 and read the 0-60 and
# 0-100 km/h times with tools/physics-behaviour.py summary.
# clock-hz 60
input 0 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 360 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 366 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 480 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 486 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 600 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 606 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 720 1000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 726 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
input 780 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
wait 900 3000 vehicle
capture 1090 start
input 1100 0000 0 255 0 0 0 0
capture 1820 end
input 1820 0000 0 0 0 0 0 0
stop 1830
